le<float> Rectangle;\n}\n```\n\nBut was unable to because defaultp is defined as such:\n\n```\n#define defaultp    highp\n```\n\nIt works if the definition is changed to the following:\n\n```\n#define defaultp    ::glm::precision::highp\n```\n\nIs this sort of reusability desirable? If so, then updating the definition would be helpful, I think.\n","closed_by":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/150/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/150/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}